{
  "id": "MAT.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "MAT",
  "reference": "Matt. 4",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus Is Tested in the Wilderness",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Jesus was led by the Spirit into the wilderness to be tempted",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "by the devil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After fasting forty days and forty nights, he was hungry.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The tempter came to him and said, \"If you are the Son of God, tell these stones to become bread.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus answered,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"It is written: 'Man shall not live on bread alone, but on every word that comes from the mouth of God.'",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.4.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.4.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.4.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.4.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the devil took him to the holy city and had him stand on the highest point of the temple.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"If you are the Son of God,\" he said, \"throw yourself down. For it is written:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "MAT 4:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\" 'He will command his angels concerning you,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "MAT 4:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and they will lift you up in their hands,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "MAT 4:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "so that you will not strike your foot against a stone.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus answered him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"It is also written: 'Do not put the Lord your God to the test.'",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.4.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.4.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.4.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.4.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Again, the devil took him to a very high mountain and showed him all the kingdoms of the world and their splendor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"All this I will give you,\" he said, \"if you will bow down and worship me.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus said to him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Away from me, Satan! For it is written: 'Worship the Lord your God, and serve him only.'",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.4.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.4.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.4.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.4.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the devil left him, and angels came and attended him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus Begins to Preach",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Jesus heard that John had been put in prison, he withdrew to Galilee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leaving Nazareth, he went and lived in Capernaum, which was by the lake in the area of Zebulun and Naphtali—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to fulfill what was said through the prophet Isaiah:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Land of Zebulun and land of Naphtali,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "MAT 4:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the Way of the Sea, beyond the Jordan,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "MAT 4:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Galilee of the Gentiles—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the people living in darkness",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "MAT 4:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "have seen a great light;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "MAT 4:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "on those living in the land of the shadow of death",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "MAT 4:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "a light has dawned.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From that time on Jesus began to preach,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Repent, for the kingdom of heaven has come near.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.4.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.4.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus Calls His First Disciples",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As Jesus was walking beside the Sea of Galilee, he saw two brothers, Simon called Peter and his brother Andrew. They were casting a net into the lake, for they were fishermen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Come, follow me,\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.4.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.4.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"and I will send you out to fish for people.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.4.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.4.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At once they left their nets and followed him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Going on from there, he saw two other brothers, James son of Zebedee and his brother John. They were in a boat with their father Zebedee, preparing their nets. Jesus called them,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and immediately they left the boat and their father and followed him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
